# AXI_data_integrity.md F8/F10 + the store_write() unconditional-commit fix --
# validation sample. This is p3t3_sample.list (AXI_ooo.md Phase 3's expanded
# sample, so the same-ID checker's own coverage is not lost) PLUS all eight
# wstrb tests, which are the only tests that opt into wstrb_compare_enable and
# therefore the only ones that exercise the re-enabled verify_read() checker.
#
# Run: python3 axi4_regression.py --lsf --test-list di_sample.list -p 20 -t 1200

